### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5140/api/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer dev-token

### Get a user by id
GET http://localhost:5140/api/users/{a393bc64-53e6-4710-bbe9-3602066bb3b1}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer dev-token

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:5140/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer dev-token

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com"
}

### Update an existing user
PUT http://localhost:5140/api/users/{a393bc64-53e6-4710-bbe9-3602066bb3b1}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer dev-token

{
  "firstName": "Janet",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "janet.smith@example.com"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:5140/api/users/{a393bc64-53e6-4710-bbe9-3602066bb3b1}
Authorization: Bearer dev-token

### Test exception handling
GET http://localhost:5140/api/test/throw
Authorization: Bearer dev-token

### Test authentication
GET http://localhost:5140/api/users
Authorization: Bearer dev-token

### Test authentication with invalid token
GET http://localhost:5140/api/users
Authorization: Bearer bad-token

### Test authentication with missing token
GET http://localhost:5140/api/users